(7834340, 1311507, 91496, '<td valign="top">
No comments always sucks.
<br/>
<br/>Love the composition with the insect kind of perpendicular to the diagonal.  I think what held you back score-wise was the lack of depth of field.  Stopping down to f11 or f16 would have put more in focus.  Looks like you had plenty of light and the ISO would not have gone to crazy with a smaller aperture.</td>', 'No comments always sucks.

Love the composition with the insect kind of perpendicular to the diagonal.  I think what held you back score-wise was the lack of depth of field.  Stopping down to f11 or f16 would have put more in focus.  Looks like you had plenty of light and the ISO would not have gone to crazy with a smaller aperture.', '2026-08-22 20:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
